    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Flight Attendant\nCelebration Day at SFO\nTuesday, August 20th\n10:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m.\nSan Francisco Airport Commission Aviation Library\nLouis A. Turpen Aviation Museum\nInternational Terminal - Level 3\nSan Francisco International Airport\nSFO\nMuseum\nUnited Arlines flight attendant uniform 1973-1976\nDesigner Jean Louis\nUniform by Fashionaire, a Division of Hart, Schaffner \u0026 Marx\nwool, synthetic fabric\nSFO Museum\nGift of United Airlines Historical Foundation\n2012-100.071. 072, 081,3115.L2013.0601.050, 051, 052, 120",
      "Flight Attendant Celebration Day at SFO\nTuesday, August 20th 10:00 a.m. to 3:00 p.m.\nSan Francisco Airport Commission Aviation Library and Louis A. Turpen Aviation Museum\nInternational Terminal - Level 3 San Francisco International Airport\nPlease join us for an open house celebrating Flight Attendants of the past and the\npresent from all air carriers. A program of talks, short subject films, and commemorations\nwill be presented throughout the day, and featuring the current museum exhibition\nUnited We Stand: Female Flight Attendant Uniforms of United Airlines.\nFor program information and directions, please visit: www.rafa-cwa.org or www.SFOMuseum.org\nComplimentary refreshments, and Airport parking garage tickets will be validated at the museum.\nThis event is open to the public free of charge.\nParticipating Partners\nRetiree Association of Flight Attendants-CWA (RAFA)\nAssociation of Flight Attendants-CWA (AFA)\nUnited Airlines Historical Foundation (UAHF)\nSFO Museum"
    ],
